program	set_nocopy_key_error.saw
triple	arm64-apple-darwin
twin	same
expect	error
build	refused	set element type `Counted` must be copyable (trivial, Copy, or ExplicitCopy with retain semantics): `Counted` is NoCopy
meets_expect	yes
log	"error: set element type `Counted` must be copyable (trivial, Copy, or ExplicitCopy with retain semantics): `Counted` is NoCopy"
log	"  --> examples/set_nocopy_key_error.saw:16:13"
log	"     |"
log	" 16 |     var s = Set<Counted>()"
log	"     |             ^"
log	""
log	"error: `Set.insert` requires `T` to be `Copy` — it forwards `T` to ``Map.insert``, which needs it to be `Copy`; `Counted` is move-only"
log	"  --> examples/set_nocopy_key_error.saw:17:14"
log	"     |"
log	" 17 |     let _ = s.insert(Counted(id: 1))"
log	"     |              ^"
log	"   hint: pass a type on the `Copy` tier, or rewrite the body to move `T` instead of duplicating it. A body that means to duplicate declares `<T: ExplicitCopy>` and spells `.copy()`"
log	""
log	"2 error(s) generated"
